cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NaijaBase in research, teaching, or a product, please cite it as below."
title: "NaijaBase: Open data for Nigeria's places, people, and government"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-14"
url: "https://github.com/vearse/NaijaBase"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vearse/NaijaBase"
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "NaijaBase contributors"
type: dataset
keywords:
  - Nigeria
  - open data
  - administrative boundaries
  - wards
  - civic data
abstract: >-
  NaijaBase is a community-maintained, machine-readable dataset covering
  Nigeria's 36 states and Federal Capital Territory, local government areas,
  wards, geopolitical zones, languages, festivals, political parties,
  senatorial districts, and federal constituencies.
